### [NEW] `backend/asr/__init__.py`
* Package exports: `BaseASREngine`, `FasterWhisperEngine`, `StreamingASRManager`.

### [NEW] `backend/asr/asr_engine.py`
* Defines `BaseASREngine` abstract class for pluggable ASR engines (Module 3 fallback architecture).
* Implements `FasterWhisperEngine`:
  * Model loading (`tiny` int8 CPU).
  * Method `transcribe(audio_16k_float32, language="en") -> list[dict]`.
  * Extracts segment text, start/end timestamps, and confidence scores.

### [NEW] `backend/asr/streaming_asr.py`
* Implements `StreamingASRManager`:
  * Manages rolling audio context buffer.
  * Implements `LocalAgreement` word-level prefix matching stabilization.
  * Emits `partial` and `final` transcript events with timestamps.
  * Prevents duplicate text repetition.

### [NEW] `backend/asr/test_asr.py`
* Standalone test suite:
  1. Tests ASR on synthetic & real English speech audio (Clear speech, YouTube style, Fast speech, Speech + Music).
